WEBVTT

00:00:00.332 --> 00:00:02.724
Grid Bot Builder. Grid Bot Blueprint.

00:00:03.234 --> 00:00:05.612
Lesson three. What is a grid bot.

00:00:06.671 --> 00:00:10.394
Education only. Not financial advice. This

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:12.673
is general information and doesn't

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:15.029
consider your objectives, financial

00:00:15.029 --> 00:00:18.023
situation or needs. Crypto is high risk.

00:00:18.483 --> 00:00:20.707
You could lose all the money you put in.

00:00:21.398 --> 00:00:26.704
Crypto carries a risk of total loss. The

00:00:26.704 --> 00:00:29.347
prices are public historical daily closes,

00:00:29.347 --> 00:00:34.768
marked Example. Past performance is not a

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:40.088
reliable indicator of future results. A

00:00:40.088 --> 00:00:42.500
grid bot places orders that wait inside a

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:45.230
top and a bottom you already measured. A

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.434
limit order is an order that waits at a

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:50.188
price you choose. A market order does not

00:00:50.188 --> 00:00:52.783
wait. It buys or sells straight away, at

00:00:52.783 --> 00:00:56.144
the prices people are already offering. A

00:00:56.144 --> 00:00:58.911
grid bot doesn't predict the price. It

00:00:58.911 --> 00:01:03.481
waits. By the end you will know what a

00:01:03.481 --> 00:01:08.410
grid bot is. You will know which side of

00:01:08.410 --> 00:01:13.388
the middle buys and which side sells. You

00:01:13.388 --> 00:01:15.723
will know why the price touching a line is

00:01:15.611 --> 00:01:20.877
not the same as making money. The exchange

00:01:20.877 --> 00:01:23.325
is the app or website where people buy and

00:01:23.325 --> 00:01:25.990
sell crypto. The book is that exchange's

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:28.747
list of everyone's waiting orders. A cross

00:01:28.747 --> 00:01:31.482
is the price line touching a rung. A fill

00:01:31.482 --> 00:01:34.809
is an order that actually trades. Limit

00:01:34.809 --> 00:01:37.329
orders wait at a price. They wait their

00:01:37.329 --> 00:01:39.737
turn at that price. A market order does

00:01:39.737 --> 00:01:44.619
not wait. The daily close is the last

00:01:44.619 --> 00:01:47.843
price of each day. The middle rung on this

00:01:47.843 --> 00:01:50.550
chart is 27630, and the daily close

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:53.830
crossed it ten times. These ten marks are

00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:56.203
crosses, not fills. They are marked

00:01:56.203 --> 00:01:58.483
Example, and they are not money you made.

00:01:59.218 --> 00:02:01.553
There are three buy rungs below the middle

00:02:01.411 --> 00:02:03.994
and three sell rungs above it. They sit

00:02:03.994 --> 00:02:07.600
about 900 apart. On 18 August 2023 the

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:11.476
close was 26050, below the middle, so that

00:02:11.476 --> 00:02:18.729
day was on the buy side. From 19 July 2023

00:02:18.772 --> 00:02:24.903
to 16 October 2023 the price stayed

00:02:25.306 --> 00:02:27.637
between 24930 and 30331. The daily close

00:02:27.637 --> 00:02:30.147
crossed the middle rung ten times. That is

00:02:30.147 --> 00:02:32.634
the path next to the band. It is marked

00:02:32.634 --> 00:02:36.114
Example, and it is not a forecast. Worked

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:38.681
check. Three buy rungs sit below the

00:02:38.681 --> 00:02:41.216
middle and three sell rungs sit above it,

00:02:41.216 --> 00:02:44.886
about 900 apart. On 18 August 2023 the

00:02:44.886 --> 00:02:49.288
close was 26050, below the middle. The ten

00:02:49.288 --> 00:02:52.587
crosses are not a gain. Here is one step,

00:02:52.587 --> 00:02:55.125
slowly. Price falls through a buy rung,

00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:57.531
and the waiting buy can fill. You then

00:02:57.531 --> 00:03:02.210
hold a little more coin, and a sell can be
written one rung higher. If price rises

00:03:02.210 --> 00:03:04.377
through that sell, it can fill, and you

00:03:04.367 --> 00:03:06.983
hold a little more cash. A cross is only

00:03:06.983 --> 00:03:09.645
the price touching the line. A fill is the

00:03:09.645 --> 00:03:12.220
order actually trading. This is how the

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:14.668
picture works. It is not a promise that

00:03:14.668 --> 00:03:19.284
you make money. This example ended in

00:03:19.284 --> 00:03:25.593
October 2023. On 23 October 2023 the daily

00:03:26.086 --> 00:03:29.637
close was 33086, above 30331. The price

00:03:29.637 --> 00:03:31.899
did not come back, so the waiting orders

00:03:31.899 --> 00:03:34.302
inside the old band no longer matched the

00:03:34.302 --> 00:03:36.471
path. That is why you write the stop

00:03:36.471 --> 00:03:40.092
before you start. Your turn. Draw a top

00:03:40.092 --> 00:03:42.574
and a bottom. Put three buys below the

00:03:42.574 --> 00:03:45.170
middle and three sells above it. Write one

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:47.394
stop sentence for when the price leaves.

00:03:49.743 --> 00:03:52.190
Five labels cover the picture: upper,

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.821
lower, levels, side, and stop. On the

00:03:54.821 --> 00:03:57.155
card, Upper is the top edge, Lower is the

00:03:57.155 --> 00:03:59.639
bottom edge, Levels are the rungs, Side is

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:04.427
what you hold, and Stop is your rule. When

00:04:04.427 --> 00:04:06.540
price steps down through a rung, a buy

00:04:06.403 --> 00:04:09.099
limit that was waiting there can fill. You

00:04:09.099 --> 00:04:13.470
then hold a little more coin, and a sell
can be written one rung higher. That

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:15.615
change in what you hold is how a grid

00:04:15.615 --> 00:04:20.803
works, and it is not a profit. When price

00:04:20.803 --> 00:04:23.138
steps up through a rung, a sell limit that

00:04:22.963 --> 00:04:25.490
was waiting there can fill. You can hold

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.994
less coin and more cash. This is only an

00:04:27.994 --> 00:04:33.532
example. What you hold changes. Price

00:04:33.532 --> 00:04:35.712
bounces: coin and cash swap back and

00:04:35.712 --> 00:04:38.985
forth. Price leaves: mostly coin or mostly

00:04:38.985 --> 00:04:42.432
cash. After an order fills, the bot puts a

00:04:42.432 --> 00:04:47.750
new waiting order on the next line. Point

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.986
and say the five: Top, Bottom, Levels,

00:04:49.986 --> 00:04:55.157
What you hold, and Stop. The path on the

00:04:55.157 --> 00:04:57.449
diagram is a made-up path, drawn so you

00:04:57.449 --> 00:05:00.118
can see crossings. It is not a chart of a

00:05:00.118 --> 00:05:02.285
day that happened, and it is not a path

00:05:02.182 --> 00:05:04.808
you should expect. A cross is the price

00:05:04.808 --> 00:05:10.068
line touching a rung. A common miss is to

00:05:10.068 --> 00:05:12.452
describe the bot as earning while price

00:05:12.452 --> 00:05:14.903
chops. The mechanism is fills and

00:05:14.903 --> 00:05:17.843
inventory. A result would require a future

00:05:17.843 --> 00:05:21.977
that this page does not have. This course

00:05:21.977 --> 00:05:27.304
is not connected to any exchange. Orders

00:05:27.304 --> 00:05:30.370
wait. Inside your range. Stop: your rule

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.968
if price leaves. What you hold changes.

00:05:34.244 --> 00:05:36.555
Your turn: draw a band, label the five

00:05:36.555 --> 00:05:41.967
words, and draw one step down. It is not a

00:05:41.967 --> 00:05:44.025
signal, not a fund, and not a person

00:05:44.025 --> 00:05:47.020
watching the market for you. If a sentence

00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:49.292
needs one of those, delete the sentence

00:05:49.292 --> 00:05:54.582
and return to the five labels. A grid here

00:05:54.582 --> 00:05:57.043
means limit orders waiting inside the band

00:05:57.043 --> 00:06:02.095
you measured. Three buy rungs sit below

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:04.615
the middle. Three sell rungs sit above it.

00:06:07.585 --> 00:06:09.809
When the price left the band in October,

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:14.881
that picture no longer applied. Next

00:06:14.931 --> 00:06:17.864
lesson: market regimes. A market regime is

00:06:17.864 --> 00:06:20.330
the kind of market you are in, for example

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:23.222
sideways or trending. Bring the page with

00:06:23.222 --> 00:06:25.280
the band and the stop rule, and leave

00:06:25.191 --> 00:06:27.900
every figure marked Example. No order is

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.136
sent between lessons.

